  {
    "id": "10568318",
    "original": "日本の建前と本音という概念は、僕にとって、互いに嘘をついてるだけだと思う。表面的なものだけじゃない？本当は？気持ちを傷つけないためと分かってても、やっぱりあまり好きじゃない。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "10568319",
        "text": "To me, the Japanese concept of \"tatemae to honne\" is just about lying to each other. Isn't it overly superficial? What about sincerity? I know it's about being considerate of others' feelings, but I still don't really like it."
      }
    ],
